{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-03-29 22:21:00', 'title': 'SDG&E ADDS SECOND ENERGY STORAGE FACILITY IN SAN DIEGO TO STRENGTHEN GRID RELIABILITY AND ADVANCE CLEAN ENERGY GOALS', 'text': "SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LESS THAN A YEAR AFTER IT COMPLETED THE TOP GUN ENERGY STORAGE FACILITY IN THE MIRAMAR AREA, SAN DIEGO GAS & ELECTRIC (SDG&E) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF A SECOND ENERGY STORAGE PROJECT IN THE CITY OF SAN DIEGO. SDG&E SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF CUSTOMER SERVICES AND EXTERNAL AFFAIRS SCOTT CRIDER, SDG&E VICE PRESIDENT OF ENERGY INNOVATION MIGUEL ROMERO AND LOCAL LABOR LEADERS CUT THE RIBBON ON THE REGION'S LATEST ENERGY STORAGE FACILITY LOCATED IN"}